  "question": {
    "text": "A ladder rests against a vertical wall at an angle <math><mi>α</mi></math> to the horizontal. If the foot is pulled away through a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>,&nbsp;then it slides a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> down the wall, finally making an angle <math><mi>β</mi></math> with the horizontal. The value of&nbsp;<math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>10</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "None of these",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let, the length of the ladder be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi></math> and <math><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is the wall.<br /><img src=\"assets\\st0037_9774f5ccf40f.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.47361in;height:1.48681in\" /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi></math><br />Now, <math><mi>B</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>l</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>l</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>l</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math><br />Also, <math><mi>B</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>l</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>l</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>l</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math><br />Dividing equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>"
  }
}